  m_Name: Evento_EpidemiaDeGolpesDigitais
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Epidemia de Golpes Digitais
  _titleEn: Digital Scam Epidemic
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Com mais servi\xE7os e pagamentos pela internet, cresce tamb\xE9m a
    fraude digital, que atinge principalmente quem tem menos experi\xEAncia com tecnologia."
  _summaryEn: With more services and payments online, digital fraud also grows, hitting
    mostly those with less experience with technology.
  _realWorld: "O Banco Central criou mecanismos de seguran\xE7a no Pix, como o de
    devolu\xE7\xE3o em caso de fraude, depois do aumento de golpes com transfer\xEAncias
    instant\xE2neas."
  _realWorldEn: Brazil's Central Bank added safeguards to Pix, its instant payment
    system, such as a refund mechanism for fraud, after scams with instant transfers
    increased.
  _tradeOffs: "Educa\xE7\xE3o digital, alertas e canais r\xE1pidos de den\xFAncia
    reduzem os danos."
  _tradeOffsEn: Digital literacy, alerts and fast reporting channels reduce the harm.
  _sources:
  - Label: Banco Central, Pix
    Url: https://www.bcb.gov.br/estabilidadefinanceira/pix
